## Quick Start

```bash
git clone <repo-url>
cd {{ repo_slug }}
bash scripts/bootstrap.sh   # install prerequisites, sync deps, advise on PATH
```

Once `scripts/` is on your `PATH`:

```bash
croot check        # lint + typecheck + test
croot doctor       # diagnose environment issues
```

